## notes
user "testudo": the second factor stays in the existing user store; the model holds no credentials
password hashes are not imported: the model holds identities and roles, not credentials
rule 5 (77c31cedb396): matches traffic over the rate "5/minute", which is not modelled yet; not imported, because without the threshold it would match all traffic
rule 6 (6bf218784510): action "log" has no equivalent (a rule must decide); not imported
tunnel wg0: the private key stays on the node; the model only references it
tunnel wg0: peer "wg0-peer-03" has no allowed IPs; not imported
tunnel wg1: the interface has no address; not imported
